OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Foccasionally heavy rain in the evening
OL,7,Fwill gradually ease but a few light
OL,8,Fshowers will continue overnight.
OL,9,
OL,10,CThursday:FA mainly cloudy and breezy
OL,11,Fmorning with the odd light shower over
OL,12,FAngus. Dry and bright in the afternoon
OL,13,Fwith winds becoming light.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRather
OL,16,Funsettled with with showers or longer
OL,17,Fspells of rain at times but also some
OL,18,Fdrier and brighter interludes.
